1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
AVA: That signal came from inside this house.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:11,000
LEO: The transmitter has been disconnected for ten years.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,000
AVA: Then why does the voice know my name?

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
LEO: Whatever it says, do not open that door.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:31,000
AVA: It says my brother is still alive.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:39,000
LEO: Ava, your brother is standing behind you.
